---
const { relationshipHref = '/graph' } = Astro.props as { relationshipHref?: string };
---

<section class="home-hero" id="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-hero-title">
  <div class="home-hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow">Macroeconomics, made legible</div>
    <h1 id="home-hero-title">看懂经济，<br /><span>而不只是看数据。</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">从数据、关系到传导，建立你的宏观经济认知框架。</p>
    <div class="home-hero-actions">
      <a class="home-button home-button-primary" href="#macro-state">看当前宏观状态</a>
      <a class="home-button home-button-secondary" href={relationshipHref}>探索宏观关系</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="home-hero-map" aria-label="MacroLens 的宏观理解路径">
    <div class="home-brand-line">看懂钱，如何流动。</div>
    <p>把原始读数变成可以继续探索的宏观理解。</p>
    <ol class="home-brand-steps">
      <li><span>01</span><b>Data</b></li>
      <li><span>02</span><b>Signals</b></li>
      <li><span>03</span><b>Relationships</b></li>
      <li><span>04</span><b>Transmission</b></li>
      <li><span>05</span><b>Understanding</b></li>
    </ol>
  </aside>
</section>
